# TASK-ARCH-005 (RISK_REGISTER.md R16): Stancl\Tenancy\Bootstrappers\
# FilesystemTenancyBootstrapper (config/tenancy.php, 'suffix_storage_path' =>
# true) creates a real, separate storage_path() subtree per tenant at runtime
# - e.g. storage/tenant{tenant-id}/{app,framework,logs}/... - the exact same
# kind of generated runtime content storage/framework/cache/data/.gitignore
# etc. already exclude for the central app, just not a path stock Laravel's
# own .gitignore anticipates. Never commit tenant runtime storage.
/storage/tenant*/
